    "Orange Cloud 出自柘家科技，以上是我们开发的其他 App。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orange Cloud is made by Zhe Tech. These are our other apps."
          }
